<title>VENEZUELA: Caracas benchmark leads bolsa to ninth record.</title>
<headline>Caracas benchmark leads bolsa to ninth record.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share prices on the Caracas Stock Exchange rocketed across the board to mark a ninth consecutive record level in busy trade led by benchmark Electricidad de Caracas, brokers said.</p>
<p>According to preliminary figures from the exchange, the market's 19-share  .IBC index rose 6.60 percent to 5,919.10.</p>
</text>
